<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">星宝档案</text><text class="title">每个孩子都有自己的节奏</text></view><block wx:if="{{children.length}}"><view wx:for="{{children}}" wx:key="id" class="card" bindtap="edit" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="row"><text class="card-title">{{item.nickname}}</text><text class="tag">点击修改</text></view><text class="muted">性别：{{item.genderText}} · 出生日期：{{item.birthday || '未填写'}}</text><text class="muted">干预年限：{{item.interventionYears || '未填写'}}</text></view></block><view wx:else class="empty">还没有星宝档案，先建立一份吧。</view><button wx:if="{{!children.length}}" class="primary" bindtap="create">新建档案</button></view>
